            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Because that behaviour is different from other functions.\r\n\r\nThis should now be addressed on latest `main`, but in the other direction: argument validation in all `set_picker_xxx()` functions is now done before early return in case there is no active picker. This seems like a more \"safe\" direction to go here.",
